    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;HD-2D JRPG made with RPGBAKIN Engine&quot;</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936520/extras/ab7e1373d728382664d911fdeb75f6e7.avif?t=1751780812\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0fStory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adam, a loyal soldier of the Edward Kingdom, sets off on a journey alongside his childhood friend, Prince Ed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their mission: to find a cure for the ailing king \u2014 and perhaps uncover a deeper truth about the world beyond the kingdom\u2019s borders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they will face challenges, encounter strange lands, and confront the mysteries that lie in wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will their bond survive the trials ahead? And what fate awaits their kingdom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936520/extras/b227ba76abdf3a688422104627993370.avif?t=1751780812\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaeGameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the golden age of classic JRPGs, this game features turn-based command battles and a focus on exploration and steady progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time to roam the world, strengthen your party, and unravel the story bit by bit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though the game is compact in volume, it\u2019s packed with heart and crafted with care for fans of nostalgic RPG adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936520/extras/b742fc9c93f6a148595877018d5a8174.avif?t=1751780812\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7eAbout the Developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I\u2019m Yuburo \u2014 and this game is a dream come true.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever since I was a kid, I\u2019ve wanted to make my own RPG. Now, that dream is finally coming to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the scope is modest, I\u2019ve poured everything I could into this little adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love classic pixel-art RPGs, meaningful journeys, and timeless storytelling, I hope you\u2019ll give it a try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you so much for your support \u2014 and I look forward to seeing you on release day!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;HD-2D JRPG made with RPGBAKIN Engine&quot;</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936520/extras/ab7e1373d728382664d911fdeb75f6e7.avif?t=1751780812\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0fStory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adam, a loyal soldier of the Edward Kingdom, sets off on a journey alongside his childhood friend, Prince Ed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their mission: to find a cure for the ailing king \u2014 and perhaps uncover a deeper truth about the world beyond the kingdom\u2019s borders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they will face challenges, encounter strange lands, and confront the mysteries that lie in wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will their bond survive the trials ahead? And what fate awaits their kingdom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936520/extras/b227ba76abdf3a688422104627993370.avif?t=1751780812\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaeGameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the golden age of classic JRPGs, this game features turn-based command battles and a focus on exploration and steady progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time to roam the world, strengthen your party, and unravel the story bit by bit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though the game is compact in volume, it\u2019s packed with heart and crafted with care for fans of nostalgic RPG adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936520/extras/b742fc9c93f6a148595877018d5a8174.avif?t=1751780812\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7eAbout the Developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I\u2019m Yuburo \u2014 and this game is a dream come true.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever since I was a kid, I\u2019ve wanted to make my own RPG. Now, that dream is finally coming to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the scope is modest, I\u2019ve poured everything I could into this little adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love classic pixel-art RPGs, meaningful journeys, and timeless storytelling, I hope you\u2019ll give it a try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you so much for your support \u2014 and I look forward to seeing you on release day!</p>",
